  "body": "## 1.42.0 (2026-11-18)\n\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Features\n* feat(cloud): pick the exact connected git provider for repositories by @tofarr in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19762\n* feat(verify-openhands): every run has a non-loopback plain-HTTP origin by @enyst in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19756\n### Bug Fixes\n* fix(filters): close EnumFilterDropdown menus on Escape by @enyst in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19817\n* fix(automations): restore native webhook source validation by @1kailas in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19600\n* fix(clipboard): support fallback when Clipboard API is unavailable by @lx3133584 in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/18583\n### Documentation\n* docs(verify-openhands): map maintenance 2026-11-17 by @enyst in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19818\n* docs(verify-openhands): map maintenance 2026-11-18 by @enyst in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19840\n### Maintenance\n* chore(deps): bump framer-motion from 14.10.1 to 14.11.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19806\n* chore(deps): bump downshift from 9.4.1 to 9.5.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19808\n* chore(deps): bump axios from 1.21.0 to 1.21.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19809\n* chore(deps): bump vite from 8.3.6 to 8.3.7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19805\n* chore(deps): bump posthog-js from 1.447.3 to 1.447.6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19807\n* chore(deps-dev): bump the eslint group with 3 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19804\n* chore(deps): bump i18next from 27.0.1 to 27.1.0 in the i18next group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19802\n* chore(deps): bump isbot from 5.2.2 to 5.2.3 in the react-router group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19803\n* chore(deps-dev): bump electron from 45.2.3 to 45.3.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19826\n* chore(deps): bump i18next from 27.1.0 to 27.1.1 in the i18next group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19824\n* chore(deps): bump lucide-react from 1.70.0 to 1.71.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19830\n* chore(deps): bump posthog-js from 1.447.6 to 1.447.10 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19829\n* chore(deps): bump framer-motion from 14.11.1 to 14.12.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19827\n* chore(deps): bump @microlink/react-json-view from 1.31.48 to 1.31.50 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19828\n* chore(deps-dev): bump @testing-library/user-event from 14.6.8 to 14.6.9 in the testing group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19825\n\n## New Contributors\n* @1kailas made their first contribution in https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/pull/19600\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/OpenHands/OpenHands/compare/v1.41.0...v1.42.0\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [Release Please](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please). See [documentation](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please#release-please).\n<!-- AGENT_CANVAS_DOCKER_START -->\n\n<!-- macos-install-note -->\n### macOS install note\n\nThe app isn't signed with an Apple Developer ID yet, so macOS may call a\ndownloaded build *\"damaged\"* — it's Gatekeeper quarantine, not a bad file.\nAfter moving the app to Applications, clear the flag once, then open normally:\n\n```sh\nxattr -dr com.apple.quarantine \"/Applications/OpenHands Agent Canvas.app\"\n```\n\nSigning + notarization is tracked in OpenHands/OpenHands#16774.\n",
